 "remarks": "Own your piece of the Stamford Sky! UPTO $10,000.00 1st Time Home-buyer Benefit is Possible Here! Look down on creation from this bright + stylish 10th Floor apartment in the heart of vibrant downtown! This sun-filled + spacious 1-bed, 1-bath condo at popular Fountain Terrace offers an open flow of entertainment spaces, featuring an accommodating living/dining area with luxury vinyl flooring (installed 8/2025) large windows and a door to the balcony, where you'll enjoy postcard quality cityscape views! Adding to the ease of living here is a well managed community featuring secure gated entry, outdoor pool, fitness center + beautifully manicured grounds. The monthly Fee covers heat, hot water, parking for 1 car (2nd car $25.00) + cable. Live in the action and enjoy the convenience of life in the heart of Stamford, steps to popular restaurants, theater, Uconn, library, parks and more!",
